        "requirementsDigest": "Digest of the ticket's normalized requirements content as of the last observation, used to detect meaningful content changes independent of cosmetic edits to the source ticket.",
        "providerUpdateMarker": "Provider-supplied change marker captured with the most recently observed snapshot, such as an updated-at timestamp or revision token. Compared on the next sync to detect whether the ticket changed upstream without re-fetching and re-normalizing the full snapshot.",
